 "title": "Second Half Property Taxes Due October 31st",
 "text": "Second Half Property Taxes Due October 31st\nOctober 18, 2026\nDavison County, South Dakota\nHome\nInfo »\nA Brief History of Davison County\nNOTICES\nCommittees\nDavison County Facts\nDirectory of Services\nEmployment Opportunities\nStaff Email\nTownship Board Members\nDavison-Hanson County Ambulance District Board\nDepartments »\nDavison County Auditor\nCommunity Health Nurse\nEmergency Management\nDepartment of Equalization\nExtension Office\nFairgrounds Complex »\nFairground Rates\nFairgrounds Rental Policies\nFairgrounds Scheduling Procedures\nHighway Department\nHuman Resources\nMaintenance Department\nPlanning and Zoning\nRegister of Deeds »\nForms\nPersonally Identifiable Information\nRegister of Deeds’ Fees\nRegister of Deeds Checklist\nFiling Liens\nSheriff’s Office »\nCivil Process & Eviction\nJail\nPistol Permits\nState’s Attorney\nTreasurer\nVeteran’s Office\nWeed Department\nWelfare Office\nCommission »\nDistrict 1\nDistrict 2\nDistrict 3\nDistrict 4\nDistrict 5\nMinutes »\nPlanning and Zoning Agenda and Minutes\nDavison-Hanson County Ambulance District Agenda and Minutes\nDrainage Agenda and Minutes\nCommission Agenda and Minutes »\nArchived Commission Minutes\nHow Do I…\nEmployment\nQuick Links\nPublic Safety Center Project\n« All Events\nSecond Half Property Taxes Due October 31st\nOctober 1 - October 31\n« Register of Deeds Vital Record Request Wait times & Issuance Holds\nDavison County Offices, State Offices and Courthouse Closed 10/12/26 »\nProperty Tax Information\nThe first half of property taxes are due April 30 , and the second half are due October 31 of each year. Please bring your tax notices with you.\nThere is a .833% monthly penalty for delinquent taxes.\nThose wishing to pay by credit card may do so by visiting the online property tax payments link below. Credit card service fees apply.\nTax payments may be mailed to the Treasurer’s Office at 200 East 4th Ave., Mitchell, SD 57301 and MUST be postmarked by April 30 or October 31, respectively. Please send your tax stubs to ensure proper credit to the correct parcels of land. Receipts will be mailed if the tax payment is accompanied by a stamped envelope.\nOnline Property Tax Payments\nTo Pay Property Taxes, click Pay Property Taxes\nESCROW COMPANIES~ Call us at 605-995-8617 for rates to get the file directly downloaded to you.\nAdd to calendar\nGoogle Calendar\niCalendar\nOutlook 365\nOutlook Live\nDetails\nStart:\nOctober 1\nEnd:\nOctober 31\n« Register of Deeds Vital Record Request Wait times & Issuance Holds\nDavison County Offices, State Offices and Courthouse Closed 10/12/26 »\nReturn to top of page\nCopyright © 2026 on Genesis Framework · WordPress · Log in",
